  ('c950c437-52c5-58b6-99c6-91851ebee81c', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Read: "Caravanserais along the old trade routes were simple buildings, often little more than a walled courtyard surrounded by rooms. ____ they played an enormous role in trade, giving merchants a safe place to rest, store goods, and exchange news." Which choice best fills the blank?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Just as modestly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"comparison-for-concession"},{"text":"Modest as they were,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Once they were modest,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"time-for-concession"},{"text":"Because they were modest,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-for-concession"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Modest as they were,$q$, $q$The first sentence stresses how plain the buildings were, and the second says they mattered greatly anyway, so "Modest as they were" concedes the plainness before stating their importance. "Because they were modest" is wrong because simplicity is not what made them important to trade.$q$, 'draft', null)
